{
  "$comment": "One record per (declared view column, source field) pair in a CREATE VIEW script. n-1 is several records sharing one target_column. Field names deliberately match hop_record where the meaning matches, so the completeness and fidelity checks work unchanged. No datatype/size: a view declares neither.",
